{'symbol': 'HII', 'date': '2022-11-02 17:00:00', 'title': 'HII INCREASES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND TO $1.24 PER SHARE', 'text': 'NEWPORT NEWS, VA., NOV. 02, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- HII (NYSE:HII) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $1.24 PER SHARE, A $0.06 INCREASE OVER THE $1.18 PER SHARE DIVIDEND PAID IN EACH OF THE PRIOR FOUR QUARTERS. THE $1.24 PER SHARE DIVIDEND WILL BE PAYABLE ON DEC. 9, 2022, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON NOV. 25, 2022.'}{'symbol': 'HII', 'date': '2022-11-02 14:00:00', 'title': 'HII-BUILT AIRCRAFT CARRIER & SHIPBUILDERS GET NATIONAL SPOTLIGHT ON VETERANS DAY', 'text': "NEWPORT NEWS, VA., NOV. 02, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- WHEN MEN'S COLLEGE BASKETBALL TEAMS GONZAGA AND MICHIGAN STATE FACE-OFF NEXT WEEK ON AN AIRCRAFT CARRIER IN SAN DIEGO, SHIPBUILDERS AND VETERANS FROM HII (NYSE: HII) AND ITS NEWPORT NEWS SHIPBUILDING DIVISION WILL SHARE IN THE NATIONAL SPOTLIGHT."}